      Not "in total", which the data cannot promise: a task that crossed the
      version 10 migration counts from one however many times it had already
      come back, so "ten in total" would be a claim about a history the app
      declined to invent. "for" bounds the span without saying where it started.
    -->
    <plurals name="task_repeat_for_occurrences">
